{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And they shall be for lights in the firmament of the heaven to give light upon the earth</b> — He added that their light would reach the earth, for it is possible that there would be seen for them light in the heavens and they would perform all the actions mentioned without giving light upon the earth. Therefore He said that they shall be for lights in the firmament of the heaven, looking toward the earth, and they shall give light upon it."], :book :genesis, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-21T22:14:24.829997211Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}